Embedded public forms:
- src/FairShare.Api/Templates/AL/*.xlsx are the State of Alabama Administrative Office of Courts' child-support
  worksheet workbooks (Form CS-42 Rev. 5/2022, Form CS-42-S Eff. 6/2023), published at eforms.alacourt.gov.
  They are included unmodified; FairShare only fills in their input cells.

Embedded fonts:
- src/FairShare.Web/wwwroot/fonts/lora-latin.woff2 (Lora, Cyreal) and karla-latin.woff2
